{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d73e17f7-470d-85b2-88ca-014924065acd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T13:09:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good afternoon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. I have question about parking at the beach. In winter, off-season. Can I park there now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help. Which beach are you thinking of? Easton's, Gooseberry, one of the others?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easton's Beach. I want to go walk Saturday, this Saturday. Is there parking rule in off-season? Need sticker or pay or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the off-season it's usually a lot more relaxed than summer. The lot's generally open for people walking the beach, but let me double check whether there are any restrictions right now, since we just had that storm. Can you hold a sec?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting. So the beach lot is open for parking this time of year. The one thing is, after a storm sometimes sand or water gets pushed into part of the lot, so some spots may be coned off. Just follow any signs posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, signs. Storm was Sunday into Monday, three days ago, so maybe still some sand. Okay. [pause] Sorry, one moment, alarm is going in my house. Smoke alarm, maybe battery. [pause] Okay, it stopped now. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all! Glad it stopped. If it chirps again it's usually just the battery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, probably. So Saturday, I just park, no sticker, no pay. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, as far as I know for the winter months. If anything changed I'd expect it to be posted at the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:08:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One more thing. Will somebody need to call me back, follow-up call? Or this is all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:08:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're all set. Nothing for us to follow up on. If you want to be extra sure about the lot Saturday morning, you can call us back and we'll tell you what we know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no follow-up needed. Good. Thank you, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:09:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, enjoy your walk!"
    }
  ],
